    "job_description": "Job Description — AI/ML Engineer Intern\r\nCompany\r\n\r\nTalentFlow AI\r\n\r\nRole\r\n\r\nAI/ML Engineer Intern — Intelligent Recruiting & NLP\r\n\r\nAbout the Role\r\n\r\nWe are looking for an enthusiastic AI/ML Engineer Intern to work on an intelligent recruitment platform that uses Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning to analyze resumes, compare candidates against job descriptions, rank applicants, and generate recruiter-friendly insights.\r\n\r\nThe intern will work with Python, Machine Learning, NLP, embeddings, LLMs, and information retrieval to build and evaluate AI-powered recruitment features.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\nDevelop Python services and data-processing pipelines for resume and job-description analysis.\r\nApply NLP techniques for text extraction, similarity matching, information retrieval, and candidate ranking.\r\nBuild and evaluate machine-learning models using appropriate evaluation metrics.\r\nWork with embeddings, vector search, or Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) where appropriate.\r\nCreate APIs or interactive prototypes for AI-powered recruiting workflows.\r\nClean, analyze, and visualize datasets.\r\nDocument experiments, results, and findings.\r\nCollaborate with engineers to test, debug, and improve AI features.\r\nRequired Qualifications\r\nCurrently pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, or a related field.\r\nStrong Python programming skills.\r\nHands-on understanding of Machine Learning and model evaluation.\r\nExperience with:\r\nPandas\r\nNumPy\r\nScikit-learn\r\nBasic-to-intermediate knowledge of Natural Language Processing (NLP).\r\nUnderstanding of:\r\nEmbeddings\r\nSemantic similarity\r\nInformation retrieval\r\nFamiliarity with Git/GitHub.\r\nFamiliarity with building or consuming APIs.\r\nPreferred Qualifications\r\nExperience with Large Language Models (LLMs).\r\nExperience with Generative AI.\r\nExperience with RAG systems.\r\nExperience with vector databases or vector search.\r\nFamiliarity with Transformers.\r\nExperience with PyTorch or another deep-learning framework.\r\nExperience building applications using Streamlit, FastAPI, or similar frameworks.\r\nKnowledge of SQL/databases.\r\nPrevious internship or project experience involving real-world AI/ML systems.\r\nWhat We Look For\r\n\r\nThe ideal candidate should demonstrate practical implementation of AI/ML concepts through projects or internships rather than only academic coursework.\r\n\r\nThe screening will particularly value:\r\n\r\nPython + Machine Learning fundamentals\r\nNLP experience\r\nLLM / Generative AI experience\r\nEmbeddings and semantic search\r\nRAG / information retrieval\r\nPractical AI/ML projects\r\nAPI and application development experience\r\nJob Type\r\n\r\nInternship\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nRemote / Hybrid\r\n\r\nExpected Skills\r\n\r\nPython | Machine Learning | NLP | Pandas | NumPy | Scikit-learn | LLMs | Generative AI | RAG | Embeddings | Vector Search | FastAPI | Streamlit | Git | SQL | PyTorch",
